      "writtenOn": "2023-05-12T21:30:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Linux behavior might be the same on that code path, but once you get the code that sends TIPC_CTRL_MSGTYPE_UNMAP_REQ, I don\u0027t see how this would work correctly with an old trusty image.",
